  "sn22.55:8.13": "",
  "sn22.55:9.1": "",
  "sn22.55:9.2": "",
  "sn22.55:9.3": "Thus becoming a non-returner. ",
  "sn22.55:9.4": "Here the monk quotes the Buddha, as indicated by the close <i lang='pi' translate='no'>-ti</i> in the text. ",
  "sn22.55:10.1": "This question is also at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn22.81/en/sujato#4.4'>SN 22.81:4.4</a>. “Without delay” means “in this very life”. ",
